%% MUPP-046 Site name
%% What a request without the site cookie gets: the four public files, the password page, or 401.
flowchart TD
    A[Request without the site cookie] --> B{Path}
    B -- /losenord --> C[Password page: Kusinportalen: R1]
    B -- icon.svg, icon.png, apple-icon.png, manifest.webmanifest --> D{GET or HEAD?}
    D -- yes --> E[200, the file: R4]
    D -- no --> F[401: R4]
